{
  "course": "初中60短文",
  "passage": 3,
  "title": "Passage 3",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 1,
      "sourceSentenceId": 1,
      "chunkId": "s03-p01",
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p01.mp3",
      "en": "A marathon is a long running race of 26.2 miles.",
      "cn": "马拉松是一项长跑比赛，全长26.2英里。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s03-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p02.mp3",
      "en": "The first Olympic marathon was held in Athens.",
      "cn": "第一届奥林匹克马拉松比赛在雅典举行。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s03-p03",
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p03.mp3",
      "en": "Now, many cities host their own marathons every year.",
      "cn": "许多城市每年都会举办自己的马拉松比赛。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s03-p04",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p04.mp3",
      "en": "Themes of marathons add fun and meaning to the hard miles.",
      "cn": "马拉松比赛的主题为其困难的赛程增添了乐趣和意义。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s03-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p05.mp3",
      "en": "Runners run for helping sick kids, celebrating important events, or just enjoying nature.",
      "cn": "赛跑选手可以是为帮助生病的孩子、庆祝重要的事件而奔跑，或者可以只是为享受自然而奔跑。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s03-p06-01",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p06-01.mp3",
      "en": "There is a famous marathon in Gisborne, New Zealand,",
      "cn": "此地有一项著名的马拉松赛事。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s03-p06-02",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p06-02.mp3",
      "en": "which is known for being the first city in the world to welcome the sunlight every day.",
      "cn": "此地有一项著名的马拉松赛事。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s03-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p07.mp3",
      "en": "Runners can greet the sunrise as they race along the golden sandy beaches.",
      "cn": "选手们可以在沿着金色的沙滩奔跑时迎接日出。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s03-p08",
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p08.mp3",
      "en": "Marathon routes bring people more understanding of the old sport.",
      "cn": "马拉松比赛的路线能让人们对这项古老的运动有更多的了解。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s03-p09",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p09.mp3",
      "en": "Some routes provide great sporting challenges for runners.",
      "cn": "有些路线对选手来说是巨大的运动挑战。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s03-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p10.mp3",
      "en": "The routes offer various surfaces, from bridges to sand to hills.",
      "cn": "从桥梁到沙地再到山丘。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s03-p11",
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p11.mp3",
      "en": "Runners of all skill levels can sweat freely and push their limits in the race.",
      "cn": "所有技能水平的选手都能在比赛中尽情挥洒汗水，挑战自己的极限。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s03-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p12.mp3",
      "en": "Some routes are well planned for runners to explore the many sides of a city.",
      "cn": "有些路线经过精心规划，可让选手探索城市的方方面面。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s03-p13",
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p13.mp3",
      "en": "For example, the route of the Great Wall Marathon takes the runners along the great wonder of the world.",
      "cn": "长城马拉松的路线就带领选手们沿着这一世界奇迹奔跑。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 14,
      "chunkId": "s03-p14",
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p14.mp3",
      "en": "The race can be an amazing chance to get to know Beijing, its people and local food.",
      "cn": "可以让选手们了解北京及其人民和当地美食。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 15,
      "chunkId": "s03-p15",
      "image": "assets/images/15.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p15.mp3",
      "en": "A marathon is quite a journey for runners to enjoy the run, challenge themselves and experience the culture.",
      "cn": "选手们可以享受跑步的乐趣、挑战自我和体验文化。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 16,
      "chunkId": "s03-p16",
      "image": "assets/images/16.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s03-p16.mp3",
      "en": "There is so much more behind the race for us to explore.",
      "cn": "这项赛事背后还有更多值得我们探索的东西。"
    }
  ],
